  "prefLabel": "Env-A 2902.09 Allowance transfer",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 2902.09 “Allowance transfer” means the conveyance of one or more allowances from one account to another by whatever means, including but not limited to purchase, trade, or gift or at auction, in accordance with the procedures established in this chapter.\n\nSource. #10002, eff 10-1-11 (from Env-A 2903.09); ss by #12995, eff 2-25-20",
